OL,3,GNEWSAEvacuations as residents report
OL,4,Agarden 'explosion'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of properties on a York street
OL,7,Fwere evacuated after residents reported
OL,8,Fan "explosion" in a nearby garden.
OL,10,FPolice and the fire service were called
OL,11,Fto Crossfield Crescent in Fulford at
OL,12,Fabout 12:00 BST on Wednesday following
OL,13,Freports of a fire.
OL,15,FLewis Abley, 35, who lives on the
OL,16,Fstreet, said he climbed onto his garage
OL,17,Froof to see what was going on after
OL,18,Fhearing a loud bang while eating lunch,
OL,19,Fand he spotted heat radiating from his
OL,20,Fneighbour's garden, prompting him to
OL,21,Fjump over the fence to help.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
