OL,3,GNEWSAEvacuations as residents report
OL,4,Agarden 'explosion'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbley said a flame about 5-7ft (1.5-2m)
OL,7,Flong was coming from a large gas
OL,8,Fcanister and "the heat that was coming
OL,9,Foff it was just ridiculous".
